2956-- The class ($0, `census/`): the sealed three-month run opened 69 questions in 59 days; Claude's reading of the first 50 (not reviewed by Alex) marks 12 duplicates and 10 that should not have opened, 5 borderline. Matching merged 39 of 122 candidates; the candidates opened new fall in three verdict classes (parsed from the decisions' reason text, not yet verified case by case): the collision judge's "distinct question in one matter", "same question" verdicts the code still opened (two traced to a model-written period start), and twins never compared.
