1. **High — The product milestone rule contradicts the question-types table and omits the reason for the chosen milestone.** The new rule says one question asks when shipping begins, with launch as evidence ([page, line 336](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:336)); the table still allows a question about either launch or shipping ([line 264](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:264)). D248 says to ask about **the step that brings revenue**, identifying shipping as that step in the examples ([D248, line 2961](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2961); [plan, line 237](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:237)). The new wording drops that reason and presents shipping as an unconditional rule.

2. **High — The new “small matters” wording conflicts with the evidence-retention test.** The page says small matters “只作证据” ([line 297](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:297)); similar wording appears in [lines 218 and 265](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:218). Yet the existing evidence rule says a statement is retained only if an analyst would note it because it changes the likelihood of an answer, and that noise is not retained ([lines 357–359](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:357)). D248 says a matter below the opening threshold is evidence ([line 2964](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2964)); it does not say that otherwise irrelevant or rejected material must be retained. The page needs to reconcile the opening decision with the separate retention decision.

3. **High — The prerequisite for switching on evidence consolidation is incomplete.** The new rule says to measure whether consolidation hides qualifications before enabling it ([page, line 252](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:252)). D248 also requires measuring the accuracy of **both the original-speaker and original-day fields** on which the rule depends ([line 2965](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2965)). That second prerequisite is absent from the page. The page’s “生效” status at [line 146](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:146) also makes the conditional activation easy to miss.

4. **High — The gold section presents the version-3 gold as the current reference for version 4.** The new summary says only the question-opening part must be re-derived ([page, line 208](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:208)), while the gold section still calls the signed version-3 file the definitive reference and presents its question counts without a version-4 caveat ([lines 458–465](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:458)). D244 requires the gold to be re-derived and frozen when the standard changes, and the scorer to refuse a gold for another standard ([D244, line 2934](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2934)). The existing file and counts can remain as historical records, but the page does not distinguish them from a version-4 reference.

5. **Medium — “The model-written period start is not a fact” is an unsourced assertion.** The new sentence makes that categorical claim before saying it must not block a merge ([page, line 338](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:338)). D248 decides the latter behavior for event and policy questions; it does not declare every model-written start to be non-factual ([D248, line 2963](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2963); [plan, line 239](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/research/2026-10-30-question-identity/plan.md:239)).

6. **Medium — The new summary overstates the single-question rule for different periods and milestones.** It says different deadlines, milestones and period descriptions of one bet “是一题” ([page, line 297](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:297)). The detailed rules allow a later-deadline successor after the first question expires and separate milestones an analyst would bet on separately ([lines 335–336](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:335)). D248 also limits the period decision to a company’s fiscal-year question and a calendar-year estimate ([lines 2960–2962](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2960)). The summary should carry those boundaries rather than read as an unconditional merge rule.

The new Alex principle quotation is exact in both occurrences ([page, lines 209 and 592](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:209); [D248, line 2957](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2957)). The recorded answer “A， A” also matches [D248, line 2964](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2964). I found no misquote among the added quotations.

**Serious findings remain.****仍有严重的标准漂移。** 例如，页面正文说小交易的陈述要先判断是否值得保留，但冲突表又说它“只作证据”。

1. **高：小事项的证据处理仍有矛盾。** [冲突表 B3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:603)说，规模不够的单笔交易“只作证据”；但[问题类型表](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:265)说，这类陈述是否保留要按证据规则判断。[D248 第 6 条](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2964)规定的是后者：不开问题，并不自动意味着保留证据。第一轮的这一问题因此尚未完全修好。

2. **高：开题门槛在正文中只明确覆盖了部分事项。** [开题测试](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:302)仍把“竞争位置”列为值得追的理由，而新加的收入、利润、现金或信用风险门槛只点名“交易、产品、项目”。这留下例如政策或共同量问题的歧义：它若只改变竞争位置，是否可以开题？[D248 第 6 条](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2964)将该门槛写为开题的一般条件，没有限定在这三类事项。

3. **高：金标重推范围比决定写得窄。** [金标说明](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:459)要求重推“开题部分”，并说证据部分 D248 没改；[页首摘要](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:208)也只要求重推开题部分。但 [D244](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2934)要求标准改变后重推并重新冻结金标，没有只限开题部分。D248 也改变了[重复证据在判断时的呈现](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2965)和[日历年估计的分量](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2962)。这不预设证据金标一定需要修改，但页面不能据此免除对它的重推核查。

4. **中：重复证据规则遗漏了指定的测量材料。** [账本规则](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:252)现已补上启用前要测隐藏内容和两个字段的准确性，但没有写明用什么材料测。[D248 第 7 条](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2965)明确要求在 **G3 金标**上测这两件事。

**结论：仍有严重发现。**
codex
**仍有一处严重矛盾：页面一处要求把答案能分开变化的部分都分题，另一处要求先看分析员是否会分别下注。** 例如，两个数字可以各自变化，但如果分析员不会分别下注，按 D248 不应仅凭它们能分开变化就开两题。

1. **高：旧的分题规则与 D248 冲突。** [问题写法](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:289)说“能各自朝相反方向走的部分要分开”。但新加的[总规则](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:332)和 [D248](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2958)都说，除了答案能分开变化，还要分析员会分别下注，才能分成两题。

2. **中：金标说明漏说了日历年估计的分量变化。** [金标说明](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:459)说 D248 第 4 条“改的是开哪一题”，却没有提它也决定了证据分量。[D248 第 4 条](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/DECISIONS.md:2962)和[页面正文](/Users/lchingen/hivemind-extraction-quality-2026-10-28/docs/prd/05-extraction-standard.html:337)都说，财年和日历年差得多时，日历年估计的分量低一点。金标逐条核对时需要包括这项变化。

新增的 Alex 原话和七个回答未发现误引。

**仍有严重发现。**
